  "bio": "Carter Clove is a renowned tattoo artist based in Columbus, United States, specializing in unique styles including dotwork, fineline, and sketch. His work exudes an unparalleled mastery of his craft, often drawing inspiration from nature. Despite his high level of skill, Carter maintains a down-to-earth attitude, showcased through his role as a Skate Dad.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Columbus, Ohio, United States\n\nColumbus Ohio Tattoo Artist \nOwner @cloventattoo \nFather/Husband/Nature Lover\nMFA from University Washington \nEst. Cloven Tattoo in 2011",
